        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86711, Back-to-Back Modern Warwick Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Warwick Back-to-Back Handle Pair is a modern set of 2 door pulls packaged with the hardware to mount them back to back on a single door (one on the interior and one on the exterior). This Warwick Door Pull Pair is available in a wide array of contemporary finish colors. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/warwick-door-pull-emtek-86711\"><b>Warwick Pulls with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Warwick Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) door pulls,  (2) 2-1/2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) #10-32 set screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DP86711-specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek Warwick Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86711:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86712:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
